  <h1>Whistleblower Award Guides</h1>
  <p><em>Published by The Click Lab Agency LLC. Last reviewed October 2026. Not legal advice.</em></p>

  <p>These guides explain how money is awarded after the government collects it. They are not a filing service, and they are not a rating of lawyers. Each one is about a decision people get wrong before they ever talk to the agency: which statute applies, what the percentage is a percentage <em>of</em>, and which procedural step (a Form TCR date, a Form 211, a sealed complaint) is the one that matters.</p>
  <p>Four programs do most of the work this site covers. They are easy to mix up because each one pays a percentage, and the percentages look similar. They are different statutes, filed in different places, with different thresholds.</p>

